        "original_id": "5fad0dc9-dba9-5d7d-9382-8c731369e3f8",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Priyadarshan, Jackie Shroff, Dimple Kapadia, Shajith Koyeri\n- Companies: Shogun Films\n- Products: Gardish, Kabhi Na Kabhi, Omkara\n- Events: Filmfare Awards, National Film Awards, IIFA Awards\n- Topics: Bollywood, Hindi films\n\nFacts:\n- Jackie Shroff, whose full name is Jaikishen Kakubhai \"Jackie\" Shroff, was born on 1 February 1957 and is an Indian actor.\n- Gardish is a 1993 Hindi film directed by Priyadarshan and starring Jackie Shroff and Dimple Kapadia.\n- For Gardish, Jackie Shroff was nominated for the Filmfare Best Actor award, and Dimple Kapadia was nominated for the Filmfare Best Supporting Actress award.\n- Shogun Films produced Hindi films including Gardish and Kabhi Na Kabhi, and those films introduced director Priyadarshan in Bollywood.\n- Shajith Koyeri is a sound designer who won a National Film Award for Omkara, as well as two Filmfare Awards and two IIFA Awards.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "957052fc-f9d2-5833-bb53-4c0bec341d81",
        "text": "Page: Gardish. Sentence: Gardish is a 1993 Hindi film directed by Priyadarshan which stars Jackie Shroff and Dimple Kapadia.\nPage: Gardish. Sentence: Jackie Shroff was nominated for Best Actor Filmfare awards, and Dimpla Kapadia for the Best supporting Actress award.\nPage: Jackie Shroff. Sentence: Jaikishen Kakubhai \"Jackie\" Shroff (born 1 February 1957) is an Indian actor.\nPage: Shogun Films. Sentence: It has also produced Hindi films such as \"Gardish\" and \"Kabhi Na Kabhi\", which introduced director Priyadarshan in Bollywood.\nPage: Shajith Koyeri. Sentence: A National Film Awards winning sound designer for Omkara, Shajith also won two Filmfare awards and two IIFA Awards.",
